<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχνῑτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make</i> or <i>produce artificially, fabricate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταφορὰς ἀπὸ τῶν φυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.171
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (prob.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				374
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεξείδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Mis.</u>
					345b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τοῦτο</span>
			<i>treat</i> it <i>secundum artem</i>, Olymp.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.98
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
				</span></i>
			 Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				36.5
			</span></i>, etc.: in bad sense, <i>pervert by art</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὸς τ. λόγους ἐπὶ τὰ πονηρότερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Is.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>use art</i> or <i>cunning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					2.64
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				88
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>A<i><span class="en">
				p.97
			</span></i> H.: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				5.8.11
			</span></i>.</div>
